  AND g.segments = '[{"r":"わか","t":"若"},{"t":"い"},{"r":"ごろ","t":"頃"},{"t":"はよく"},{"r":"あそ","t":"遊"},{"t":"んだものだ"},{"t":" and "},{"r":"と","t":"人"},{"t":"は"},{"r":"し","t":"死"},{"t":"ぬものだ"},{"t":" look unrelated until you read "},{"t":"もの"},{"t":" literally. Both say \"that is a thing\": the second about how the world reliably is, the first about how life reliably was.\n\nGenerality is the common element, and it is why "},{"t":"ものだ"},{"t":" cannot be used for a single occurrence. "},{"r":"きのう","t":"昨日"},{"r":"あそ","t":"遊"},{"t":"んだものだ"},{"t":" is wrong: one afternoon is an event, not a thing that holds."}]'::jsonb
