},{"t":"否","r":"ひ"},{"t":"か"}],"to":[{"t":"か"},{"t":"否","r":"いな"},{"t":"か"}],"why":"否 here is いな."},{"word":"安否","from":[{"t":"安","r":"やす"},{"t":"否","r":"ひ"}],"to":[{"t":"安否","r":"あんぴ"}],"why":"Compound is あんぴ."}]}'::jsonb, '{"furigana":[{"r":"ひ","t":"否"},{"t":" survives in "},{"r":"やす","t":"安"},{"r":"ひ","t":"否"},{"t":", "},{"r":"ひてい","t":"否定"},{"t":" and in "},{"r":"ひ","t":"否"},{"t":" read "},{"t":"いな"},{"t":". "},{"t":"かどうか"},{"t":" says \"whether, how, whether\"; "},{"t":"か"},{"r":"ひ","t":"否"},{"t":"か"},{"t":" says \"whether or not\", with the actual word for no in the middle.\n\nThe two are the same question, one modern and one classical, and that is the only difference between them: "},{"t":"か"},{"r":"ひ","t":"否"},{"t":"か"},{"t":" is what "},{"t":"かどうか"},{"t":" wears to a formal occasion."}]}'::jsonb, 'ai', 900, 'pending'
