ething firm as its footing ("},{"r":"ほうりつ","t":"法律"},{"t":", "},{"t":"データ"},{"t":", "},{"r":"じじつ","t":"事実"},{"t":"), though "},{"r":"けいけん","t":"経験"},{"t":"に"},{"r":"もと","t":"基"},{"t":"づく"},{"r":"かん","t":"勘"},{"t":" shows the base need not be documentary."}]}'::jsonb, 'ai', 900, 'pending'
